Sajjad Ka Gala Hai<br>
<br>
Touqe garaa'n me jakda Sajjad ka gala hai<br>
Har gaam per jafa hai beemare karbala hai<br>
<br>
Baba ki laash ran me pamaal hogaee hai<br>
Bete pa ya ilahi ye kaisi bebasi hai<br>
Laashe pa sar jhukaye aansu baha raha hai<br>
<br>
Kufe ko qafela ab jata hai qaidiyon ka<br>
Pursaa(N) koi nahi hai Zahra ki betiyon ka<br>
Sajjad e natawaN hi ab meer e qafela hai<br>
<br>
Naqay se gir gaee hai seene pa sone wali<br>
Naize pe ruk gaee hai kyun Shaah ki sawari<br>
Koday laga k zalim Abid se poochta hai<br>
<br>
kantoun pa khainchte hain beemar o natawaN ko<br>
Zanjeer khooN se likhti hai gham ki dastaaN ko<br>
Abid ki bekasi per dil khoon ro raha hai<br>
<br>
Maa, behnoun k Phupi k sar per rida nahi hai<br>
Phailaye paaoun baitha darbar me laeeN hai<br>
Kursi nasheeN hain har su aur Aale Mustafa hai<br>
<br>
Baba ko yad kar k lo chal basi Sakina<br>
Armaa to thay bohot per ja na saki madina<br>
Daaghe judai dil per bhai k ye naya hai<br>
<br>
Zindaan me bahen ko dafna raha hai bhai<br>
Milne chali pidar se seene pa sone wali<br>
Saidaniyoun me isdam kaohram ek bapa hai<br>
<br>
Bhai se apne aksar kahti thi ye Sakina<br>
Thandi jagah pa mujhko ay bhai dafn karna<br>
Gham iska qalbe Abid ko khooN rula raha hai<br>
<br>
<br>
Hai aarzu k moula karbo bala bulain<br>
Sajjad ki lahad per bhi ashke gham bahain<br>
Lab per yehi Aqeel aur Farhan k dua hai<br>
